{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"1":"Purification (Kitab Al-Taharah)"},"section_detail":{"1":{"hadithnumber_first":1,"hadithnumber_last":390,"arabicnumber_first":1,"arabicnumber_last":390,"name_native":"كتاب الطهارة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":389,"arabicnumber":389,"text":"حدثنا موسى بن اسماعيل، حدثنا حماد، اخبرنا ثابت البناني، عن ابي نضرة، قال بزق رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم في ثوبه وحك بعضه ببعض","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih Lighairihi"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":1,"hadith":389}}]}